{"version":1,"content":"<p>2026美國中期選舉正在投票，改選眾議院全部435席、參議院100席中的35席，以及36州州長。</p><p>這場選舉被視為對總統特朗普2.0兩年表現的全國「公投」，焦點是民主黨能否重奪國會控制權，制衡白宮。</p><p>逾5700萬人已提前投票。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T15:02:19.578118+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T14:07:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:18:22.629429+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T14:59:06.887461+00:00","content_hash":"f5b1fbd71a04f143922f0cf451c3fb54eee81d84a834d5d712264a4a665d42e9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}